    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d53558453ccd9f5c",
      "translationZh": "看到 u/Nandakishor_ml 介绍 Laya 的帖子后，我想看看它在独立的 C++ 实现中能运行得多快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff732820f6576efb",
      "translationZh": "架构设计、训练和开源发布的功劳归于 u/Nandakishor_ml。我的贡献是推理实现：laya.cpp，它基于 ggml 构建，并使用了自定义 CUDA 内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38d7b7b4d40e86e5",
      "translationZh": "它支持全部三个检查点——英语、多语言和 typed-decisions——并原生支持分词、模型执行和输出格式化。此外还提供一个 HTTP 服务器，带有兼容 JEV 的端点。推理不需要 Python 或 PyTorch。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74936a64861b0a3f",
      "translationZh": "以下是英语模型在 RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 上的一些结果，功率上限设为 450 W：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abf03081644c1bdd",
      "translationZh": "批大小 Python BF16 C++ BF16 Python FP32 C++ FP32",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c268fbc947dcd5eb",
      "translationZh": "这些数据表示在一个固定的、包含选择题、评分题和布尔题的 250 题语料集上，每秒处理的问题数。每种精度都对 Python/C++ 进行了配对计时，并交替执行顺序。不计入加载和 JSON 传输时间。README 中有全部三个模型的完整结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6b3c378938e1e6a",
      "translationZh": "大部分优化来自消除不必要的转换和复制、在保持舍入行为不变的同时融合运算，以及改善注意力计算的内存访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7da7ce5a220144ca",
      "translationZh": "代码采用 MIT 许可证。BF16 目前需要使用文档中说明的 CUDA 13.0/cuBLAS 13.1.0 构建配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94628934ebccbeee",
      "translationZh": "使用 Codex Astra 实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
